WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:11.130
Clearly, The Commish had nothing to do on Sunday. So he just made confirming your seat a web app!

Let’s install TLPT RSVP. No bluffing required.

2
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:17.120
Start by scanning the QR Code to open the shared player link in your web browser. No account needed.

3
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.620
The app’s Add to Home Screen button opens help, or an available install prompt.

4
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.360
Here's a walk-through for both iOS and Android

5
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:31.390
iPhone or iPad: tap Share. It’s the square with the upward arrow.

6
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:38.170
Scroll to Add to Home Screen. Missing? Check Edit Actions.

7
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:44.440
Keep the name. Leave Open as Web App on, if offered. Tap Add.

8
00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:50.810
Android: use the install button if offered. Otherwise, open your browser’s menu.

9
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.784
Choose Add to Home Screen, or Install App. Browser menus vary.

10
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.766
Some Chrome versions say Install and Create Shortcut. Then tap Install.

11
00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:07.402
Finish the phone’s confirmation yourself, on each device.

12
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:12.732
Open the yellow chip icon: TLPT RSVP.

13
00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:18.976
Choose your name. For each game, tap In, Maybe, or Out.

14
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:23.430
It’s just that easy. No tanking required!
